<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64238" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λυσσ-άω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λυττάω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		part.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λυσσώων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Man.
					1.244
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.265
			</span></i> (Paul. Sil.):—<i>to be raging</i> in battle,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.71
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύσσα</span> init.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>rave, be mad</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1258
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ant.</u>
				492
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				329c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Sent.Vat.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">Man.,
			<u>AP</u></span></i>ll.cc., etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. πρὸς μεῖξιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ps.-Phoc.
					214
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρωτες λυττῶντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					586c
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., <i>desire madly</i> to do, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				2.20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of dogs,
				<i>suffer from rabies</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				298
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				604a6
			</span></i>; of wolves, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				4.11
			</span></i>; of horses, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				604b13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> causal,
				<i>make mad</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κἂν λελυσσήκῃ
			τινά</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δήγματα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Damocr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.821
			</span></i>. (<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύσσεται:
		μαίνεται</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
